  "title": "ISRO Launches NVS-03 to Strengthen India's NavIC Constellation",
  "summary": "ISRO will launch NVS-03 to strengthen India's NavIC navigation system, which currently has only three operational satellites, marking a significant step in improving navigation capabilities. The satellite will carry an indigenous atomic clock and is expected to restore the functioning of the NavIC constellation.",
